=2 Walkthrough
+ Talk to {n:Rasdinice} in {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} and choose Offensive Operations from the Campaign Ops menu. The operation costs 1 {p:Op Credit}.
+ Go to {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} and enter {z:Everbloom Hollow} through the {p:Beastman Ensign|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Beastman_Ensign} at J-7. Only the party leader needs the operation active, and the rest of the party must stand close when the leader enters.
+ Find the Orcish camp inside and destroy it. No report says which Orcs are there or how many must fall in this version. The Bastok version counts kills by rank and the Windurst version asks for 9 of 15 Yagudo, so expect a kill tally here too. __(verification needed)__
+ When the objective is met, leave through the Twilight Aureola. Leaving before that fails the operation.
+ Return to {n:Rasdinice} to receive your {p:Allied Notes}. Experience is paid when you leave the area.

=2 Notes
* Time limit: 30 minutes, as for the other nations' version and every battlefield in this zone. __(verification needed)__
* Unlock: one list asks for 16 clears of Pit Spider III, and another says the Bastok version opens after Pit Spider I. __(verification needed)__
* Rewards: no amounts are recorded for San d'Oria. At 5 stars the Windurst version pays about 6600 to 6900 experience and about 8100 Allied Notes, and the nations' versions of an operation usually pay alike. __(verification needed)__
* The game lists a unit requirement of 1~6 members, while the wikis give 3-6.

=2 Objective
Scouts report that an Orcish assault force has camped in Everbloom Hollow. Go there with the Knights of the Iron Ram by way of Vunkerl Inlet (J-7), find the camp and destroy it.
\**Unit Requirements:** 1~6 members
